  "description": "In-memory vector and BM25 text search for Mythosia VectorDb. Provides cosine similarity, text-only retrieval, configurable normalized weighted RRF, metadata filtering, upsert/delete operations, batch retrieval and counts. Filters candidates before truncation, synchronizes record and keyword-index access, and returns independent record copies. Supports cancellation while waiting for access and between batch records; batch and document replacement operations do not provide transactional rollback. What's New in v4.3.0: Removes the RAG dependency and implements IVectorStoreDiagnostics in place of IRagDiagnosticsStore; concrete diagnostic methods remain available. This minor release intentionally includes a breaking interface migration.",
