  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v4.3.0: Minor-version policy exception: includes a breaking diagnostics-interface migration. Removes the RAG.Abstractions dependency and implements optional IVectorStoreDiagnostics from VectorDb.Abstractions 4.2.0. Breaking: InMemoryVectorStore no longer implements IRagDiagnosticsStore; update interface assignments/casts and use RAG 8.3.0 for full diagnostics. Existing concrete diagnostic methods and ordinary vector/text/hybrid operations remain available. Full notes: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/blob/main/src/vectordb/Mythosia.VectorDb.InMemory/RELEASE_NOTES.md#v430",
